{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the bright future of colonization with Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122! </h2>You are greeted by the planet Sandrax-66b! <br>It\u2019s dusty. It\u2019s harsh. It\u2019s ours. <br>You have arrived on the frontline of exploring a new world. <br>And although your ship has somewhat\u2026 stopped being a ship, that\u2019s no reason to despair. Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122 believes in you! <br>And when we believe \u2014 even you will survive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.poster.avif?t=1754386745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.webm?t=1754386745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.mp4?t=1754386745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An open and fully destructible world </h2>Everything you see can be taken apart, destroyed, or set on fire. Experiment. Test. Break engineering ethics.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/a286359f2e0b0be5df009c736baad13a.poster.avif?t=1754386745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/a286359f2e0b0be5df009c736baad13a.webm?t=1754386745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/a286359f2e0b0be5df009c736baad13a.mp4?t=1754386745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Exploration of discoveries and anomalies<br>Unknown object? Mysterious signal? A melted door in 